title: Bob Gill
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

American graphic designer and illustrator (1931–2021). Co-founder of [[Fletcher/Forbes/Gill]], the London studio that later became [[Pentagram]].

coined the phrase: [[Good Graphic Design is something you can explain to someone over the telephone]]

